id=q1_audiofx
name=Quest 1 system audio effects
version=v1
versionCode=1
author=Juspertinry
description=Registers the stock AOSP audio effects that Meta left unregistered in the Quest's effects config, and moves the primary output onto the deep-buffer usecase so every stream reaches the normal mixer where a system EQ can process it. Raises output latency to roughly 230ms. Quest 1 / msm8998.
